# CLAUDE.local.md Template – Personal Project Instructions

This is a template for creating a CLAUDE.local.md file for your personal preferences on this project. This file is NOT committed to the repository (add to .gitignore). Use it for your personal preferences and customizations that don't apply to the whole team.

