## Integration Points

### CI/CD Pipeline

Skip these hooks locally:
- [ ] beforeCommit (I handle testing myself)
- [ ] beforePush (I have slow internet)
- [ ] onSave (Too noisy)

Run these hooks:
- [ ] afterCommit (Notify me if it fails)
- [ ] beforePush (Verify everything before I push)

### Local Development Commands

Commands I run frequently (help me with these):
```bash
npm run dev      # Start dev server
npm test         # Run tests
npm run lint     # Check linting
npm run build    # Build for production
```

Commands I rarely use:
- npm run migrate (I don't usually modify schema)
- npm run deploy (CI/CD handles this)

