## Time-Based Notes

### When You See Me Working Late
- Don't suggest major refactoring (I'm probably in a hurry)
- Keep suggestions focused and brief
- Don't introduce new dependencies

### On Friday Afternoons
- Don't suggest risky changes (they'll sit over the weekend)
- Focus on quick wins
- Highlight anything that needs attention Monday

### After I Haven't Worked on This for a While
- Start by asking what I worked on last
- Point out what's changed in the codebase
- Remind me of the current task

