## Template Customization Instructions

1. Copy this file to your project root as `CLAUDE.local.md`
2. Check the boxes that apply to you
3. Fill in personalized sections
4. Delete sections you don't need
5. Add `.claude.local.md` to `.gitignore` (don't commit this!)
6. Share your project's CLAUDE.md with teammates (not this file)

